# Build context is the repo root; BuildKit reads this file for Dockerfile.api only.
# Allowlist: the API and the format package it depends on. The content repository
# is cloned or mounted at runtime, never baked into the image.
*
!apps/api/
!packages/dictionary-format/
!docker/api-entrypoint.sh
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
apps/api/.env
apps/api/tests
